izartri demoiselle~
an izartri demoiselle~
An izartri sits at attention with her tail wrapped around her.
~
   She is covered in brownish orange and black striped fur.  The black stripes
are ne'er more than an inch thick and all taper to points.  Her tail is ringed
with stripes, and is no more than three inches around.  Her lean body is
fashioned almost entirely of feline design.  Uncharacteristically short and
soft fur covers her entire body.  Her toes are subtly more finger-like than
normal felines, possessing more nimbleness and less claw.  Her head is small
and round, with a short whiskerless muzzle.  It resembles that of a cheetah.  
Somehow the izartri's eyes evince acumen far above any other you've witnessed.
~
